    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. i'm just worried about it being something more random or an electrical issue that just shows up out of nowhere. like why does it seem so inconsistent? sometimes it's super loud and other times i don't hear it at all. is that normal for these parts failing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
